    "title": "Bristol's Sean Moore launches campaign for 78th District seat - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Laura Bailey ,\n17 hours ago After 20 years of working on local boards and commissions, Sean Moore is looking to serve at the state level this November. Moore, a Democrat, is challenging Republican incumbent Joe Hoxha for the opportunity to represent the 78th district in the state House of Representatives. The 78th covers portions of Bristol and Plymouth. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
